# Ju-Ju Heaps (1884): the level 10 Horde mage quest from Un'thuwa in Sen'jin
# Village, for a Ley Staff or Ley Orb.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and objects.json (Un'Thuwa, the Ju-Ju Heaps on
# the Echo Isles); Forever's quest data (quest 1884,
# checked 2026-10-14) for the races (Orc, Undead, Troll) and the reward choice;
# the quest text for Zalazane's huts.
# Why a Class guide: the Durotar route (horde/orc-troll/01-durotar) crosses the
# Echo Isles at about level 8, before the quest opens, and leaves for the
# Barrens from Razor Hill at 12; going back south for it costs a separate trip.
# Undead mages take their own level 10 quest, The Balnir Farmstead (1882), in
# Tirisfal. The breadcrumb Speak with Un'thuwa (1883, Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar or
# Thurston Xane in Thunder Bluff) is not needed: Un'thuwa offers Ju-Ju Heaps
# without it.

step Un'thuwa
  tip Un'thuwa stands in Sen'jin Village, on the Durotar coast south of Razor Hill.
  accept 1884                                 -- Un'Thuwa

step The Ju-Ju Heaps
  tip Wade across to the Echo Isles, south-east of Sen'jin. Zalazane placed the heaps among his huts on the main isle: click a heap to destroy it.
  interact 102986 quest 1884.1                -- Ju-Ju Heap

step Back to Un'thuwa
  turnin 1884 choose 9513 7508                -- Un'Thuwa
